WEBVTT

01:45.720 --> 01:47.720
Come on. Let's finish the wine.

01:47.800 --> 01:48.680
Here.

01:48.760 --> 01:50.720
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

01:57.200 --> 01:59.480
Now that Tang and Gu are here,

01:59.560 --> 02:01.480
I'll serve you some fine wine.

02:01.560 --> 02:02.760
It's my treasure.

02:02.840 --> 02:03.880
Mr. Su, no need.

02:04.960 --> 02:05.880
Your treasure?

02:05.960 --> 02:08.160
Your mom can't bear to let me drink it.

02:08.240 --> 02:10.080
This eight-treasure wine

02:10.160 --> 02:12.800
contains all the precious herbs.

02:14.400 --> 02:15.400
Look at this.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.040
Okay.

02:18.120 --> 02:19.920
- Thanks, Mr. Su.
- For the guests?

02:20.440 --> 02:22.320
You want to drink it, don't you?

02:22.400 --> 02:23.480
It's…

02:26.480 --> 02:28.320
Thanks, Mr. Su. I'll help myself.

02:30.280 --> 02:33.560
Chengcheng told me you can't drink a lot.

02:36.480 --> 02:38.400
Not as good as Gu Yu. But I'm happy,

02:39.000 --> 02:40.040
so I can drink a little.

02:40.680 --> 02:42.120
- Mr. Su, here's to you.
- Okay. Come on.

02:43.320 --> 02:44.280
Mr. Su, here's to you.

02:44.360 --> 02:46.240
- Let's drink together.
- Come on, everyone.

02:49.000 --> 02:50.000
Cheers.

02:52.360 --> 02:53.720
- Fine wine.
- Fine wine indeed.

02:53.800 --> 02:56.800
Are you competing
with each other in flattery?

03:05.520 --> 03:09.480
When I was invisible,
you were worried about me,

03:09.560 --> 03:12.640
but you needed to pretend to be happy
to comfort me.

03:12.720 --> 03:15.080
Sorry for the trouble.

03:15.160 --> 03:16.120
I'll finish this one.

03:21.400 --> 03:22.600
What's wrong?

03:23.360 --> 03:25.040
Are you so moved that you can't talk?

03:30.720 --> 03:32.120
Where's Su Chengcheng? I can't see her.

03:33.120 --> 03:34.320
Did she disappear again?

03:34.400 --> 03:36.240
That's right. Where is she?

03:36.760 --> 03:37.920
Is she back in her room?

03:38.600 --> 03:39.680
I'll check her room.

03:40.400 --> 03:42.760
- Chengcheng.
- Chengcheng.

03:42.840 --> 03:44.480
- I'll…
- Help us look for her.

03:44.560 --> 03:45.480
I'll check over there.

03:46.320 --> 03:47.360
- Wait.
- Something's wrong.

03:47.440 --> 03:48.920
I didn't wear the bracelet.

03:49.000 --> 03:51.280
Can't you see me or hear me?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.400
Chengcheng.

03:52.480 --> 03:53.320
Chengcheng.

03:54.400 --> 03:55.440
Not here.

03:55.520 --> 03:57.280
- Chengcheng.
- Chengcheng.

03:59.040 --> 04:01.400
- Chengcheng.
- Chengcheng.

04:06.080 --> 04:07.280
Not here.

04:09.200 --> 04:11.520
Dad, Mom,

04:11.600 --> 04:13.560
why are you also trying to scare me?

04:13.640 --> 04:14.720
You caught us so fast.

04:14.800 --> 04:16.160
- Yes.
- So boring.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.240
There must be a spy.

04:18.519 --> 04:19.720
- It's not our fault.
- Not our fault.

04:19.800 --> 04:22.280
- It's your sister and Yuan's idea.
- Yes.

04:23.400 --> 04:24.240
Lin Yuan.

04:25.920 --> 04:26.920
Su Qingli.

04:27.000 --> 04:28.280
Why are you so childish?

04:28.360 --> 04:30.000
You're the most childish.

04:30.080 --> 04:31.960
You posed as a doll to scare us.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.960
You had it coming, sister.

04:34.960 --> 04:36.640
How could you not tell me?

04:36.720 --> 04:37.680
Here's my confession.

04:37.760 --> 04:39.520
I was just cooperating with them.

04:40.440 --> 04:42.160
He started it first!

04:42.240 --> 04:43.080
- Yes, it's his fault.
- No.

04:43.160 --> 04:44.280
It's his fault. He started it.

04:44.800 --> 04:46.640
Okay. The show is over.

04:46.720 --> 04:47.760
Let's take a photo together.

04:48.480 --> 04:49.400
Come on.

04:50.800 --> 04:51.880
Look at the camera.

04:51.960 --> 04:54.920
- Ready. Three, two, one.
- Smile.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.960
TANG QI: DRINK THE FINE WINE
AND GROW OLD WITH YOU. THAT'S LOVE

05:04.600 --> 05:06.080
Announcement!

05:06.160 --> 05:07.480
Congratulations!

05:07.560 --> 05:10.080
Chengcheng, thank you for choosing Tang.

05:10.160 --> 05:11.000
DEAR YUAN - TBC, MR. GU
ZHOU JINLI

05:11.080 --> 05:13.920
Can't do this to a bachelor.

05:34.920 --> 05:37.080
AUTO BEAUTY FILTER

05:40.840 --> 05:44.280
AUTO BEAUTY FILTER

05:47.840 --> 05:51.160
TANG QI

05:51.240 --> 05:52.840
COPY

05:56.840 --> 05:58.240
PASTE

05:59.840 --> 06:03.120
Drink the fine wine and grow old with you.

06:03.200 --> 06:06.320
That's love.

06:08.280 --> 06:09.480
SEND

06:09.560 --> 06:13.280
WISHES COME TRUE

06:31.560 --> 06:32.640
Look.

06:34.760 --> 06:35.880
Do you remember?

06:36.520 --> 06:38.360
Yes, the class reunion.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.400
I'll forward it.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.880
SU CHENGCHENG

06:52.200 --> 06:54.040
FORWARD TO A FRIEND

06:54.120 --> 06:55.760
SEND TO: EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL GOSSIP

06:56.280 --> 06:58.120
It's better than a TV series.

06:58.200 --> 06:59.040
IS THIS REAL? I DON'T BELIEVE IT

06:59.120 --> 07:00.400
Announcement!

07:00.480 --> 07:01.560
Congratulations!

07:01.640 --> 07:02.800
Impressive!

07:02.880 --> 07:05.720
I don't believe it.
It must be an edited photo.

08:04.360 --> 08:05.360
MIDDLE SCHOOL GOSSIP

08:05.440 --> 08:06.400
DRINK THE FINE WINE AND GROW OLD WITH YOU

08:07.920 --> 08:09.200
Impressive!

08:09.280 --> 08:11.960
It's literally mind-blowing!

08:12.040 --> 08:14.280
It's better than a TV series.

08:14.360 --> 08:15.960
Su Chengcheng, you're my idol!

08:16.040 --> 08:17.560
Is this the end of the world?

08:17.640 --> 08:19.320
Even Su Chengcheng got her crush.

08:19.400 --> 08:21.400
Then I'll definitely get my crush.

08:21.480 --> 08:22.400
I don't believe it.

08:22.480 --> 08:25.360
Su Chengcheng must've edited the photo
after being rejected.

08:25.440 --> 08:27.720
Look carefully at the timing
of the screenshot.

08:27.800 --> 08:29.480
Senior Tang posted it first.

08:29.560 --> 08:31.840
Chengcheng is indeed

08:31.920 --> 08:34.360
not as shameless as you.

08:34.440 --> 08:36.159
As for the one
who said it was a fake photo,

08:36.240 --> 08:38.360
I remember our teacher said
you only cared about gossip

08:38.440 --> 08:39.919
instead of your studies.

08:40.000 --> 08:43.360
Since you're so good at irony,
why don't you open a class?

08:45.760 --> 08:48.400
Well, if this is mind-blowing,

08:48.480 --> 08:50.440
then you're watermelon rolling around.

08:51.480 --> 08:53.200
EXPERIMENTAL MIDDLE SCHOOL
ALUMNI ASSOCIATION

09:00.520 --> 09:02.400
- Yuan.
- Living in the Beauty Camera,

09:02.480 --> 09:04.280
you've forgotten your true face!

09:04.360 --> 09:05.480
How dare you laugh at Chengcheng?

09:05.560 --> 09:08.040
I must beat you to the ground!

09:24.680 --> 09:27.520
THIS ISN'T OVER! I HAVE PLENTY OF TIME!

09:41.840 --> 09:43.720
Jealousy makes you ugly!

09:49.080 --> 09:51.200
In terms of editing photos,
I'm the real expert.

09:51.280 --> 09:54.200
I even won a national award for this.

09:54.800 --> 09:56.800
You're literally saying nonsense.

09:57.680 --> 09:59.320
Who is crazy?

09:59.400 --> 10:00.680
You

10:00.760 --> 10:02.560
Who left the group?

10:02.640 --> 10:04.840
You

10:04.920 --> 10:05.960
You won?

10:06.560 --> 10:07.400
Yes.

10:08.440 --> 10:10.560
To support Chengcheng,

10:10.640 --> 10:13.920
I've decided I'll never use
Beauty Camera again.

10:14.000 --> 10:15.640
I'll only post unedited photos.

10:18.480 --> 10:20.120
Well, don't you agree?

10:23.280 --> 10:24.800
It's okay for your Moments.

10:24.880 --> 10:26.600
You can post whatever you want.

10:27.200 --> 10:29.440
However, you're sort of a public figure.

10:30.080 --> 10:33.640
Are you going to use unedited photos
in front of the media and public?

10:34.560 --> 10:37.360
Isn't this a little bit too much?

10:38.440 --> 10:40.600
How's that too much?

10:40.680 --> 10:43.120
I won't deceive the public. Am I wrong?

10:49.960 --> 10:53.800
If using filters and Photoshop properly
is deceiving people,

10:54.440 --> 10:57.320
will that make makeup
another form of deceiving?

11:04.440 --> 11:07.080
What's wrong with making
yourself more beautiful?

11:21.360 --> 11:23.080
I need some space!

11:23.160 --> 11:24.280
I want to be alone.

11:26.200 --> 11:27.480
I've made up my mind.

11:37.200 --> 11:38.400
What are you doing?

11:39.320 --> 11:40.800
I'll blow out the candles and leave.

11:40.880 --> 11:43.320
Safety first.

11:54.080 --> 11:55.400
I need my clothes.

11:56.840 --> 11:58.400
There's another one!

12:02.720 --> 12:05.280
Safety first.

12:05.360 --> 12:06.800
A little bit too much.

12:23.800 --> 12:25.240
Is she having an inner heat?

12:27.520 --> 12:29.760
I'll buy some chrysanthemum
to make tea for you.

12:39.560 --> 12:40.520
Have a nice dream.

12:57.480 --> 12:58.320
Good morning.

12:58.400 --> 12:59.920
Did you sleep well?

13:02.320 --> 13:05.840
If you're worried that I'd be upset
about what they said

13:05.920 --> 13:07.240
in the group,

13:07.320 --> 13:09.160
I can tell you that I wasn't.

13:09.240 --> 13:10.160
I slept so well.

13:11.560 --> 13:13.120
Good.

13:13.200 --> 13:16.840
I'm so glad to have such a good boyfriend

13:16.920 --> 13:18.640
and a supporting bestie.

13:18.720 --> 13:22.200
Why would I doubt myself
for what others say?

13:22.280 --> 13:25.560
I'm convinced that you're obsessed with me

13:25.640 --> 13:27.760
because I'm a great person.

13:27.840 --> 13:30.160
It's 100% true.

13:31.720 --> 13:33.400
Give me the key. I'll drive.

13:35.720 --> 13:39.360
My dad said you came so early
and didn't have breakfast,

13:39.440 --> 13:41.360
so he prepared soy milk and meat pie

13:41.440 --> 13:43.080
and asked me to give them to you.

13:46.320 --> 13:47.840
- That's too kind of him.
- Let's go.

14:14.040 --> 14:15.000
Good morning, Mr. Tang.

14:15.080 --> 14:16.120
Good morning.

14:37.160 --> 14:39.520
Well, haven't you ever seen
a couple before?

14:40.640 --> 14:42.600
I have.

14:46.280 --> 14:50.600
Well, although I commented
on your Moments last night,

14:50.680 --> 14:53.160
I still need to tell you this in person.
Congratulations.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.520
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

15:09.520 --> 15:10.360
Chengcheng.

15:10.440 --> 15:13.400
I didn't peek at you
because you found a boyfriend.

15:13.480 --> 15:15.800
I already knew it, so I wasn't surprised.

15:15.880 --> 15:17.360
I was wondering

15:17.440 --> 15:20.200
why you didn't wear makeup
or even put lipstick on,

15:20.280 --> 15:21.920
for it's a big day.

15:22.800 --> 15:24.000
Can't I come without make-up?

15:25.120 --> 15:26.240
You can.

15:34.640 --> 15:36.000
Are you serious?

15:36.080 --> 15:37.680
You can't leave her even at work.

15:48.840 --> 15:51.480
Are you serious?
You can't leave me even at work.

15:51.560 --> 15:52.680
I'm serious.

15:53.200 --> 15:56.360
I'll treat you and Chengcheng
to dinner after work.

16:00.120 --> 16:02.280
Tell me what happened.

16:05.800 --> 16:08.000
Last night, Yuan got angry,

16:08.680 --> 16:10.280
and she wouldn't reply to me.

16:10.360 --> 16:12.200
I want Su Chengcheng to ask her out

16:12.280 --> 16:13.480
and have dinner with us.

16:13.560 --> 16:15.920
She'll move on quickly after having fun.

16:16.000 --> 16:17.560
Why did she get angry?

16:22.880 --> 16:23.800
For Chengcheng?

16:24.640 --> 16:25.520
Not exactly.

16:25.600 --> 16:29.240
She was already in a bad mood
and acting on a whim.

16:29.840 --> 16:32.560
That digital chameleon
was one of her crazy ideas.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.760
Breakfast is in the fridge.
Heat the bread first.

17:03.400 --> 17:05.960
YUAN, REMEMBER TO HAVE BREAKFAST

17:41.760 --> 17:43.880
This is a leopard
from the African savannah.

17:43.960 --> 17:46.120
Right now, it's enjoying a great meal.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.560
It's eating a pony.

17:47.640 --> 17:48.480
The pony was careless

17:48.560 --> 17:50.640
and was caught by a leopard
that had been hungry for days,

17:50.720 --> 17:52.320
so now, as you can see…

17:52.400 --> 17:54.080
Are you done with your friend's matters?

17:54.160 --> 17:56.720
Can you start drawing now?

17:56.800 --> 17:58.720
I'm done with that.

17:58.800 --> 18:01.280
But I have no passion for drawing.

18:02.120 --> 18:04.040
Aren't you in a relationship?

18:04.120 --> 18:06.840
That's great material.
How can you have no passion?

18:06.920 --> 18:09.680
Maybe because I'm in a relationship,

18:09.760 --> 18:11.480
I'm not in the mood for work.

18:12.000 --> 18:14.440
Why don't you try to persuade me
to break up with him?

18:14.520 --> 18:16.040
What happened?

18:16.120 --> 18:16.960
Nothing.

18:17.040 --> 18:19.600
Everything's fine.

18:20.120 --> 18:22.320
But I've been lazy.

18:22.400 --> 18:24.280
I only want to be a couch potato.

18:26.040 --> 18:28.000
I'll visit you after work.

18:28.520 --> 18:29.480
No need.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.080
It's a deal.

18:40.680 --> 18:44.480
China has the most advanced
e-commerce industry.

18:45.800 --> 18:46.840
Our online channels

18:46.920 --> 18:49.560
have the advantage
of low investment and low cost.

18:50.240 --> 18:51.320
However, in real stores,

18:51.400 --> 18:53.800
customers can see and touch our products

18:53.880 --> 18:56.160
and feel our service.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.040
If we want them to truly understand us,

18:59.120 --> 19:02.880
we must improve the layouts
of our channels

19:02.960 --> 19:05.240
to make the customers
feel closer to our products.

19:06.160 --> 19:07.440
Therefore,

19:07.520 --> 19:09.520
after discussing it
with Mr. Tang and Mr. Tang,

19:09.600 --> 19:14.400
we decided
to open our first offline store.

19:17.400 --> 19:21.040
Since its establishment,
TBC has been valuing product R&D.

19:21.120 --> 19:23.120
Compared to other brands,

19:23.200 --> 19:26.640
we've invested much more money
into product R&D.

19:26.720 --> 19:29.160
The feedback of our customers
over the past three years

19:29.240 --> 19:31.800
has proven the high quality
of our products.

19:32.760 --> 19:35.560
In the future, I will continue
to work with the R&D Department

19:35.640 --> 19:38.400
to provide high-quality products
with low prices for our customers.

19:42.600 --> 19:43.800
Over the past few years,

19:44.440 --> 19:47.080
TBC has seen great progress
in online sales.

19:47.880 --> 19:50.960
However, I think we still need
a turning point

19:51.040 --> 19:52.120
to make TBC viral.

19:53.600 --> 19:55.880
Opening our first offline store
at this point

19:55.960 --> 19:58.400
is a decision based on
our long-term development.

19:59.000 --> 20:02.160
It can not only secure
the long-term value of our brand

20:02.240 --> 20:03.400
but promote it to more people.

20:04.000 --> 20:06.640
We're not going to promote
one product at different times.

20:06.720 --> 20:08.480
This is a long-term promotion

20:08.560 --> 20:11.160
with integrated products
and prolonged brand effect.

20:12.040 --> 20:14.800
Marketing Department, I hope
you can try your best

20:14.880 --> 20:18.440
to complete the promotion program
with the biggest investment ever.

20:21.840 --> 20:24.640
I hope all our departments
can work together

20:24.720 --> 20:27.640
to make our first offline store
a great success,

20:28.240 --> 20:31.000
so as to break the boundary
between online and offline sales,

20:31.080 --> 20:32.720
reach more consumers,

20:33.680 --> 20:37.760
and make TBC grow
in a sustainable and healthy way.

20:39.280 --> 20:40.680
- Great!
- Great!

20:45.480 --> 20:49.240
At the meeting, Yi said there are

20:49.320 --> 20:52.360
14 offline stores from seven brands
established in 2022.

20:52.440 --> 20:54.400
We can do some research

20:54.480 --> 20:57.400
to find out the customers' feedback
on these stores.

20:57.480 --> 20:59.640
Okay. I'm good at this.

20:59.720 --> 21:01.840
I was in charge of product distribution,

21:01.920 --> 21:03.960
so I'm familiar with
the business districts in the city.

21:04.040 --> 21:07.680
Yi, let's visit other
brands' offline stores

21:07.760 --> 21:08.880
to learn from them,

21:08.960 --> 21:11.360
and we'll figure out
what locations are more suitable.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.640
Yi, I'll go with Zhao Yunjie.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.320
No need.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.680
We'll open an offline store,

21:16.760 --> 21:19.560
so we also need new products
to support it.

21:19.640 --> 21:21.920
You should stay and communicate
with the R&D Department

21:22.520 --> 21:25.040
to confirm the flagship product
of our offline store.

21:25.120 --> 21:26.720
Intervening in marketing
from the beginning

21:26.800 --> 21:27.800
will be more efficient.

21:27.880 --> 21:28.800
Okay.

21:52.440 --> 21:53.400
Mr. Tang,

21:54.280 --> 21:56.160
according to the sales data,

21:56.240 --> 21:59.040
the best-selling product
of our company is perfume.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.920
Why don't we focus on the perfume series?

22:02.000 --> 22:05.320
We can set up a perfume
experience area in the store.

22:05.400 --> 22:07.640
Besides, girls are sensitive to smells.

22:07.720 --> 22:10.040
If they smell the fragrance
when passing by,

22:10.120 --> 22:12.000
they'll definitely come in
out of curiosity.

22:12.080 --> 22:13.440
I think

22:13.520 --> 22:15.560
we can also set up a special area
for lipsticks.

22:16.240 --> 22:19.320
An entire wall of lipstick
is colorful and eye-catching.

22:19.400 --> 22:20.760
People will definitely be attracted.

22:20.840 --> 22:23.360
Besides, isn't there the lipstick effect
in economics?

22:23.960 --> 22:27.000
As the world is experiencing
economic downturns,

22:27.080 --> 22:29.360
consumers will definitely favor lipsticks.

22:29.440 --> 22:32.840
The pure plant-extracted lipstick
we recently developed is very suitable.

22:40.840 --> 22:43.160
Su Chengcheng, what's your opinion?

22:47.000 --> 22:50.160
All the developed brands
have their flagship products,

22:50.240 --> 22:53.680
such as mascara, foundation,

22:53.760 --> 22:55.680
eyeshadow, and perfume.

22:56.200 --> 22:58.000
For consumers,

22:58.600 --> 23:01.760
our products are not
unique enough to compete

23:01.840 --> 23:03.920
with those of the big brands.

23:04.000 --> 23:05.240
In my opinion,

23:05.320 --> 23:08.080
if we want to attract
more consumers in a short period of time,

23:08.160 --> 23:11.080
we need to diversify our products

23:11.160 --> 23:12.560
as well as our marketing plans.

23:13.360 --> 23:14.920
I know we need to be different.

23:15.760 --> 23:18.880
But there are only limited kinds
of cosmetic products.

23:18.960 --> 23:22.000
If we can't choose mascara,
loose powder, foundation, perfume,

23:22.080 --> 23:24.080
lipstick, or eyeshadow
to be our flagship product,

23:25.240 --> 23:26.600
what should we do?

23:30.040 --> 23:31.640
I know it's a difficult question.

23:31.720 --> 23:33.680
However, in terms of supply and demand,

23:33.760 --> 23:35.160
I think this is the best way.

23:35.240 --> 23:37.000
I'm just telling the truth.

23:38.000 --> 23:39.040
It's too difficult.

23:42.680 --> 23:43.920
But I already have an idea.

23:45.520 --> 23:47.200
Mr. Tang, what is it?

23:48.120 --> 23:49.240
You'll know in the afternoon.

23:49.320 --> 23:51.560
TBC

24:11.680 --> 24:14.680
Sorry, I fell asleep
and didn't hear the doorbell.

24:14.760 --> 24:18.280
I packed your favorite half-ripe cheese
on my way here.

24:19.120 --> 24:20.160
Thanks.

24:25.640 --> 24:27.960
Tell me what happened.

24:28.640 --> 24:32.520
You've never lacked passion
for drawing since I knew you.

24:40.680 --> 24:41.840
Did you eat this in the morning?

24:43.320 --> 24:44.280
My breakfast.

24:44.960 --> 24:46.920
You didn't have breakfast?

24:47.520 --> 24:49.400
I did, but I didn't finish it.

24:49.480 --> 24:51.320
No wonder you don't have
the energy to draw.

24:53.200 --> 24:55.400
Eat some cakes first. I'll order take-out.

24:57.080 --> 24:58.920
For my interview videos in the future,

24:59.000 --> 25:01.360
don't use filters or Photoshop.

25:01.440 --> 25:02.560
Is that okay?

25:03.520 --> 25:06.000
Why don't you go to interviews

25:06.680 --> 25:08.080
without makeup?

25:10.760 --> 25:12.920
Fine, I can do that.

25:13.760 --> 25:15.600
Isn't it nice to let the readers see
what I really look like?

25:15.680 --> 25:16.880
Besides,

25:16.960 --> 25:19.480
I'm counting on my ability
instead of my face.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.640
Fine.

25:21.720 --> 25:24.080
Your rival Xiaoya will be so delighted.

25:28.040 --> 25:29.640
Is that really necessary?

25:29.720 --> 25:31.840
You threw up before I could finish.

25:35.000 --> 25:36.200
Are you okay?

25:39.400 --> 25:40.240
Here.

25:44.560 --> 25:46.280
Is something wrong with the cake?

25:46.360 --> 25:47.600
Why does it taste strange?

25:50.600 --> 25:51.640
Go away.

25:54.840 --> 25:57.520
I watched them bake it when I bought it.

26:04.720 --> 26:06.480
Something's wrong with your taste.

26:25.240 --> 26:26.080
What?

26:26.160 --> 26:29.520
No passion for work, no appetite,

26:29.600 --> 26:30.920
drowsiness,

26:32.120 --> 26:33.360
- a sudden change of taste…
- Stop!

26:33.440 --> 26:35.280
You're not a doctor, so don't diagnose me.

26:41.760 --> 26:43.560
I've been preparing to get pregnant.

26:45.240 --> 26:47.240
Take this and do a test.

26:52.480 --> 26:54.440
If you haven't forgotten
middle-school Physics,

26:54.520 --> 26:55.720
you should know

26:55.800 --> 26:58.960
photo imaging is based
on the principles of optics,

26:59.480 --> 27:01.440
that is, the propagation
and refraction of light.

27:01.520 --> 27:03.840
When light passes through
a lens into a camera,

27:03.920 --> 27:05.840
it experiences loss and refraction.

27:05.920 --> 27:09.800
Therefore, every optical lens
has some degree of distortion.

27:09.880 --> 27:12.160
Telephoto lenses
or the telephoto end of zoom lenses

27:12.240 --> 27:14.120
have pincushion distortion,

27:14.200 --> 27:16.560
while wide-angle lenses
or the wide-angle end of zoom lenses

27:16.640 --> 27:18.480
have barrel distortion.

27:19.080 --> 27:20.440
I've never known

27:20.960 --> 27:25.520
that photo-editing is actually
the right and just thing to do.

27:26.040 --> 27:29.040
It's restoring reality
instead of faking it.

27:30.760 --> 27:32.800
It's the reality that people see

27:33.320 --> 27:35.040
and think is true.

27:35.560 --> 27:36.600
What do you mean?

27:37.200 --> 27:38.800
- Do you have time?
- No.

27:46.400 --> 27:48.000
Do you think the video is clear?

27:49.120 --> 27:51.240
Very clear. Now I understand it.

27:51.320 --> 27:54.440
I want to edit all the distorted photos
on my phone right now

27:55.040 --> 27:57.080
to restore my beauty.

27:58.760 --> 27:59.680
SEND TO ALUMNI ASSOCIATION

27:59.760 --> 28:00.880
SENDING

28:05.400 --> 28:07.560
I can't argue with them like Lin Yuan did.

28:08.360 --> 28:10.000
I can only talk about the facts.

28:10.520 --> 28:12.840
I didn't have much time,
so I made a simple version.

28:12.920 --> 28:15.240
I'll make a detailed one with models.

28:17.040 --> 28:18.480
Detailed version?

28:22.840 --> 28:25.520
I think Su Chengcheng will envy me.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.200
Good coffee.

28:39.360 --> 28:41.160
How's that possible?

28:41.240 --> 28:43.720
We used protection every time.

28:47.320 --> 28:49.400
What should I do?

28:53.120 --> 28:56.040
INSPIRATION PROVIDER

28:59.760 --> 29:03.200
DEAR CHENG

29:03.280 --> 29:06.880
Chengcheng, something big happened.

29:07.800 --> 29:09.080
TBC

29:11.120 --> 29:13.400
Mr. Gu, here's the list of products.

29:19.320 --> 29:20.160
CHENGCHENG, SOMETHING BIG HAPPENED

29:24.360 --> 29:25.560
Oh my God!

29:27.440 --> 29:28.600
What?

29:31.200 --> 29:32.040
Nothing.

29:32.640 --> 29:33.760
What should I do?

29:34.280 --> 29:37.240
I don't want to get married
or have children!

29:50.560 --> 29:51.440
From Yuan?

29:56.520 --> 29:57.680
You're so nervous.

29:57.760 --> 30:00.600
Is she saying bad things about me
behind my back?

30:03.960 --> 30:05.120
Or good things?

30:14.840 --> 30:17.760
Neither bad nor good?

30:19.080 --> 30:20.640
What did she say to you?

30:21.960 --> 30:23.000
Well…

30:24.400 --> 30:25.880
She said…

30:29.280 --> 30:30.720
You're capable!

30:34.440 --> 30:37.160
Mr. Gu, read the files. I have to go.

30:38.320 --> 30:39.160
Su Chengcheng.

30:44.040 --> 30:45.720
Your WeChat…

30:53.000 --> 30:56.400
You blocked the alumni group
and didn't receive the messages, right?

30:56.480 --> 30:58.920
Check it out. Tang Qi sent a file.

30:59.920 --> 31:01.640
Okay, I'll check it.

31:27.200 --> 31:28.120
Come in.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.680
- Mr. Gu.
- What's wrong?

31:35.080 --> 31:36.080
I want to take a day off.

31:38.480 --> 31:41.200
For what? Personal matter or illness?

31:41.280 --> 31:45.240
Personal… illness.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.440
I'm not feeling well.

31:48.520 --> 31:50.000
I want to take a sick leave.

31:59.000 --> 32:00.160
Okay.

32:00.240 --> 32:02.080
Go back and get some rest.

32:04.040 --> 32:05.280
Thanks, Mr. Gu.

32:23.200 --> 32:25.080
MOM

32:29.640 --> 32:30.600
Hello.

32:31.640 --> 32:33.440
Okay, I'll pick you up.

32:44.040 --> 32:45.440
Can you feel anything?

32:50.200 --> 32:52.280
It's not different from before.

32:52.360 --> 32:53.960
Are you mistaken?

32:54.040 --> 32:55.480
Sometimes pregnancy tests can go wrong.

33:16.280 --> 33:19.160
Well, it can't be wrong.

33:20.120 --> 33:21.680
You're really pregnant.

33:30.120 --> 33:33.080
Do you want to discuss it

33:33.600 --> 33:35.120
with Gu Yu?

33:35.200 --> 33:36.440
After all…

33:36.960 --> 33:38.480
You don't have to.

33:42.320 --> 33:46.360
I've never expected to have a child

33:47.200 --> 33:49.040
or wanted to be a mom.

33:50.840 --> 33:51.880
I know.

33:56.200 --> 34:00.440
If I don't want this child,

34:01.720 --> 34:03.200
will you think I'm cruel?

34:06.640 --> 34:07.640
Really?

34:19.239 --> 34:23.120
It's hard enough
to live a good life for myself.

34:24.840 --> 34:25.719
I…

34:29.080 --> 34:31.480
I don't think I can raise a child.

34:40.600 --> 34:42.120
When I was little,

34:42.199 --> 34:45.719
I really wanted to ask my parents.

34:47.120 --> 34:48.600
Why would they bring me

34:49.120 --> 34:51.440
into this world
before thinking it through?

34:53.360 --> 34:55.360
Why couldn't they be

34:55.440 --> 34:58.080
good parents after having me?

34:58.160 --> 34:59.600
Why would they abandon me?

35:04.760 --> 35:06.080
I know.

35:06.920 --> 35:10.120
This is your body and your life.

35:10.720 --> 35:12.520
Whether to keep this child or not

35:13.040 --> 35:14.760
is up to you.

35:15.640 --> 35:17.680
No matter what you do,

35:17.760 --> 35:20.960
I'll always be by your side.

35:24.440 --> 35:27.200
Your health is the priority.

35:27.280 --> 35:29.360
No matter what,

35:29.440 --> 35:32.480
let's do a physical examination, okay?

35:32.560 --> 35:33.800
I'll be there.

35:36.240 --> 35:37.200
Okay.

36:08.480 --> 36:10.640
Strong heartbeat. The baby is healthy.

36:20.320 --> 36:21.320
Wipe it.

36:33.080 --> 36:36.360
According to your test results,
everything is normal.

36:36.440 --> 36:38.880
Given your last period,
it's about six weeks.

36:39.400 --> 36:42.000
In the early stage, women will have
differentiated symptoms.

36:42.080 --> 36:44.680
Most people will be back
to normal after three months.

36:55.280 --> 36:56.560
HEALTH HANDBOOK FOR PREGNANCY

36:58.680 --> 37:01.640
Doctor, if I don't want this child,

37:01.720 --> 37:03.880
can I schedule an abortion procedure?

37:06.200 --> 37:10.080
For healthy mother and child,
we don't recommend abortion.

37:10.160 --> 37:12.240
But if you really want to do it,

37:12.320 --> 37:15.560
for your health, you should
do it as soon as possible.

37:15.640 --> 37:17.520
It's best to do it before 14 weeks.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.440
Thanks, Doctor.

37:21.200 --> 37:22.720
- Thanks.
- You're welcome.

37:57.720 --> 37:59.040
FIRST FLOOR, D REGION

37:59.120 --> 38:00.960
Are you hungry?

38:01.040 --> 38:02.160
Do you want to eat something?

38:03.120 --> 38:04.600
I don't think I need
a follow-up examination.

38:04.680 --> 38:05.560
I think I'm fine.

38:05.640 --> 38:07.600
It can help me rest assured.

38:07.680 --> 38:09.360
You have a lot of work to do.

38:09.440 --> 38:10.520
- Mr. Gu.
- What a coincidence.

38:14.560 --> 38:16.600
I… I accompanied Chengcheng
to see a doctor.

38:16.680 --> 38:18.760
I know. She took a sick leave.

38:18.840 --> 38:20.000
My mom will see a doctor.

38:22.720 --> 38:25.200
Yuan, let me introduce you.
This is my mom.

38:26.280 --> 38:27.200
Mom,

38:28.840 --> 38:31.200
this is Lin Yuan, my girlfriend.

38:34.560 --> 38:35.920
- Hello, Mrs. Gu.
- Hello.

38:38.360 --> 38:40.400
This is Su Chengcheng, Lin Yuan's friend.

38:41.000 --> 38:42.440
She's Tang's girlfriend.

38:42.520 --> 38:44.480
- Hello, Mrs. Gu.
- Hello.

38:45.520 --> 38:47.120
Yu rarely accompanies me.

38:47.200 --> 38:49.680
I didn't expect to be so lucky
to meet you.

38:49.760 --> 38:50.840
Come to my house when you have time.

38:50.920 --> 38:52.400
Tang should also come.

38:53.480 --> 38:54.480
Okay.

38:55.480 --> 38:56.720
Su Chengcheng, are you okay?

38:58.560 --> 39:01.400
The doctor said it was gastroenteritis

39:01.480 --> 39:03.960
and gave me some medicine.
It's not serious.

39:07.480 --> 39:08.760
Good.

39:12.720 --> 39:16.280
Well, Yuan, we'll see the doctor first.

39:16.360 --> 39:17.840
I'll pick you up later.

39:17.920 --> 39:20.240
I told Tang to have dinner
with us tonight.

39:21.000 --> 39:21.960
- Okay.
- Okay.

39:22.040 --> 39:23.640
- Bye, Mrs. Gu.
- Bye.

39:23.720 --> 39:24.640
Bye, Mrs. Gu.

39:24.720 --> 39:25.560
- Bye.
- Mom, over here.

39:35.680 --> 39:37.440
Do you think he found out?

39:38.400 --> 39:40.760
No. It's a big hospital.

39:40.840 --> 39:44.000
Even if he's smart,
he can't figure out what disease it is.

39:44.080 --> 39:45.600
Don't overthink it.

39:46.320 --> 39:49.680
I'm so confused right now.
I don't want him to know.

39:49.760 --> 39:51.320
Don't worry. He won't know.

39:54.920 --> 39:56.640
You're so good at keeping secrets.

39:56.720 --> 39:58.880
When did you meet her?

39:58.960 --> 40:01.760
It's a long story.
I'll tell you when I have time.

40:14.920 --> 40:15.960
What's wrong?

40:21.520 --> 40:22.640
Mr. Gu.

40:23.680 --> 40:25.360
Mom, there's a friend.

40:25.440 --> 40:26.880
I'll chat with her. Wait a minute.

40:26.960 --> 40:28.000
Okay, go ahead.

40:28.080 --> 40:29.960
- I'll head to the doctor.
- Okay.

40:32.680 --> 40:34.040
Hello. Please wait a second.

40:35.120 --> 40:37.680
Can you tell me
where you got this handbook?

40:37.760 --> 40:39.080
Do you mean the handbook for pregnancy?

40:39.840 --> 40:42.440
In the OBGYN Department.
Just ask the nurse.

40:43.400 --> 40:44.280
Thanks.

40:48.840 --> 40:50.440
Handbook for pregnancy?

40:59.680 --> 41:01.440
I'll take you to your company
before I head home.

41:02.760 --> 41:04.440
I'll go home with you.

41:04.520 --> 41:08.520
Su Chengcheng, I'm just pregnant.
I don't have cancer.

41:09.320 --> 41:11.840
I haven't decided
whether I'll keep this child or not.

41:11.920 --> 41:13.280
Even if I decide to keep it,

41:13.360 --> 41:15.720
will you stay with me
24 hours a day during my pregnancy?

41:17.200 --> 41:18.920
I'll be annoyed, okay?

41:19.000 --> 41:21.240
Just do what you need to do.

41:22.200 --> 41:23.360
Okay.

41:23.440 --> 41:26.920
I'll get back to work,
and you'll start drawing.

41:45.840 --> 41:48.440
Don't worry. I'm serious about my health.

41:48.520 --> 41:49.680
I'll take care of myself.

41:51.080 --> 41:53.240
Tell me if anything happens.

41:53.320 --> 41:56.840
If you can't find me,
you can call my family.

41:56.920 --> 41:59.560
You know they treat you
like family, right?

42:05.280 --> 42:07.440
Normal emotional fluctuations
during pregnancy.

42:08.680 --> 42:11.120
I know. It's okay.

42:11.200 --> 42:12.200
I'm leaving.

42:12.720 --> 42:15.160
Take care. Don't overthink it.

42:18.680 --> 42:19.680
Bye.

42:35.520 --> 42:38.600
Doctor, if I don't want this child,

42:38.680 --> 42:40.760
can I schedule an abortion procedure?

42:57.760 --> 43:00.240
Have you ever cared about us?

43:00.320 --> 43:01.880
Can't you be helpful sometimes?

43:01.960 --> 43:04.720
Stop living in a dream!
What's the use of all this?

43:04.800 --> 43:06.360
Am I really not helpful?

43:06.440 --> 43:09.080
Have you ever made breakfast
or picked up our daughter?

43:09.160 --> 43:10.720
I'm an artist!

43:10.800 --> 43:12.640
- I've told you this a million times!
- Where were you?

43:12.720 --> 43:15.480
A million times? What have you told me?
What have you done?

43:15.560 --> 43:16.960
I… This is my job!

43:17.040 --> 43:18.480
My job!

43:18.560 --> 43:19.640
You don't understand!

43:19.720 --> 43:21.800
You're always holding these!

43:21.880 --> 43:24.200
- What's the use?
- Don't throw them!

43:24.280 --> 43:25.520
Don't throw them!

43:38.840 --> 43:40.160
I want a divorce!

43:40.240 --> 43:41.440
Then do it!

43:41.520 --> 43:42.680
Do you think I'm scared?

44:25.120 --> 44:30.920
WE ARE FAMILY
